{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sell a lifetime entitlement alongside a subscription and surface both flags through the paywall plugin."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Many apps offer two ways to buy: a recurring pro subscription and a one-time lifetime purchase. RevenueCat models both as entitlements; ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" checks each independently and surfaces them as the two flags on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — active subscription.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — active lifetime entitlement."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The paywall plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isGateSatisfied"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro || hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", so feature code keeps a single check while UI can branch on the underlying flags when it needs to.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the entitlement-mapping rules and edge cases, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Before-you-start","text":"Before you start"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide assumes:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have completed "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have configured "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" entitlements in the RevenueCat dashboard — typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the subscription and ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the one-time purchase. The identifiers are arbitrary; only the strings need to match what you pass into the service.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Step 1: Pass the second identifier","anchor":"Step-1-Pass-the-second-identifier","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Replace the single-entitlement init with the two-arg form:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService(","    entitlementID: \"pro\",","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both entitlements are now checked on every "},{"code":"customerInfo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfoStream()"},{"type":"text","text":" yield, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"restorePurchases()"},{"type":"text","text":" call. The active state of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pro"},{"type":"text","text":" flows into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro"},{"type":"text","text":"; the active state of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"type":"text","text":" flows into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The two flags are independent. A user with both active gets both flags set; a user with only one active gets only that flag set.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Step-2-Wire-the-service-into-the-plugin","type":"heading","text":"Step 2: Wire the service into the plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as the single-entitlement case — the plugin doesn’t need to know about the second identifier:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["plugins.register(","    PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","        state: \\.paywall,","        action: AppAction.paywall,","        extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","        service: RevenueCatPaywallService(","            entitlementID: \"pro\",","            permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"","        )","    )",")"]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Step-3-Decide-whether-feature-code-needs-to-branch","type":"heading","text":"Step 3: Decide whether feature code needs to branch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most gated features, keep using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied { … }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This stays correct whether the user has a subscription or a lifetime license, and works identically in apps that don’t sell a lifetime SKU."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Step-4-Branch-in-UI-when-copy-must-differ","type":"heading","text":"Step 4: Branch in UI when copy must differ"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the paywall sheet should be hidden for lifetime customers (so they’re not pestered to subscribe), or if the customer-center entry should be relabeled, branch on the underlying flag:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if store.paywall.hasPermanentLicense {","    Text(\"Lifetime member — thank you!\")","} else if store.paywall.isPro {","    Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.presentCustomerCenter))","    }","} else {","    Button(\"Upgrade\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"upgrade-prompt\")))","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Lifetime users typically have nothing to manage in App Store \/ Settings. Hiding the customer-center button for them avoids dead-end taps.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"When-to-skip-the-second-identifier","type":"heading","text":"When to skip the second identifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or omit the parameter) if your app has no lifetime SKU:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" then stays "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" regardless of any entitlements RevenueCat reports — even if the dashboard accidentally has a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lifetime"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement that the service is not configured to check. See the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime entitlement is ignored when no permanent-license ID is configured"}]},{"type":"text","text":" test case for the precise behavior."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"How to Add a Permanent License","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"role":"article"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoaddapermanentlicense"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"How-to Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"],"anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/ServiceReference":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","title":"Service Reference","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/servicereference","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the RevenueCat-backed ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformer that the paywall plugin consumes.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","title":"How to Present the UI","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui","abstract":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"type":"text","te